# kaleidoscopeenhanced
===
 Real-time, audio-reactive music visualizer for Windows (builds from source on Linux): 2,400+ GLSL scenes, 210 transitions, ten genre presets, transformation-chain labs with 100 variants each that walk with the music, video export (Qt6/OpenGL 4.3, 3D model import)..
